#: ../../source/optimization.rst:2
msgid "Quadratic Optimization"
msgstr "二次优化"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:4
msgid ""
"QuSpect separates problem modeling, mathematical intermediate "
"representations, hardware lowering, and execution:"
msgstr ""
"QuSpect 将问题建模、数学中间表示、硬件降级转换和执行划分为彼此独立的"
"层次："

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:23
msgid ""
"This boundary keeps a provider's matrix convention out of user-facing "
"models. It also allows the same quadratic objective to be executed by a "
"classical optimizer, lowered to a QAOA Hamiltonian, or encoded for an Ising-"
"machine backend."
msgstr ""
"这一边界使供应商的矩阵约定不会渗入面向用户的模型。它还使同一个二次目标"
"既可由经典优化器执行，也可降级为 QAOA 哈密顿量，或为 Ising 机后端进行"
"编码。"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:29
msgid "Symbolic modeling"
msgstr "符号化建模"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:31
msgid ""
"``QuadraticProgram`` is the user-facing layer.  It creates stable binary "
"variables, accepts objectives of degree at most two, and compiles supported "
"constraints into penalties:"
msgstr ""
"``QuadraticProgram`` 是面向用户的一层。它创建顺序稳定的二元变量，接受次数"
"不超过二次的目标，并将所支持的约束编译为惩罚项："

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:35
msgid ""
"a linear equality residual :math:`r(x)=0` becomes :math:`\\lambda r(x)^2`;"
msgstr "线性等式残差 :math:`r(x)=0` 转换为 :math:`\\lambda r(x)^2`；"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:37
msgid ""
"an expression explicitly declared nonnegative and constrained to zero "
"becomes the direct penalty :math:`\\lambda q(x)`."
msgstr ""
"显式声明为非负且被约束为零的表达式，转换为直接惩罚项 "
":math:`\\lambda q(x)`。"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:40
msgid ""
"For maximization, the compiler subtracts these penalties so that violations "
"are still disfavored.  ``CompilationResult`` retains the original objective "
"and constraints separately from the penalized BQM for business-level "
"evaluation and feasibility checks."
msgstr ""
"对于最大化问题，编译器会减去这些惩罚项，从而仍对违反约束的情况施加不利"
"影响。``CompilationResult`` 将原始目标和约束与加入惩罚项的 BQM 分开"
"保留，用于业务层面的求值和可行性检查。"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:45
msgid ""
"Penalties are soft constraints.  The caller must choose coefficients large "
"enough that no objective improvement can make a violating assignment "
"preferable.  Always check ``compiled.is_feasible(bits)`` after solving and "
"use ``compiled.evaluate_objective(bits)`` for the unpenalized business value."
msgstr ""
"惩罚项属于软约束。调用方必须选择足够大的系数，使违反约束的赋值无法通过"
"改善目标值而变得更优。求解后应始终检查 ``compiled.is_feasible(bits)``，"
"并使用 ``compiled.evaluate_objective(bits)`` 获取不含惩罚项的业务目标值。"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:63
msgid "Binary quadratic models"
msgstr "二元二次模型"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:65
msgid "``BinaryQuadraticModel`` stores an objective in the canonical form"
msgstr "``BinaryQuadraticModel`` 以如下规范形式存储目标函数"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:67
msgid "E(v) = c + a^T v + \\frac{1}{2} v^T B v,"
msgstr "E(v) = c + a^T v + \\frac{1}{2} v^T B v,"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:71
msgid ""
"where ``B`` is symmetric with a zero diagonal.  Variables can use either the "
"binary domain :math:`\\{0, 1\\}` or the spin domain :math:`\\{-1, +1\\}`. "
"Variable names and vector order are explicit, and all coefficient arrays are "
"copied and made read-only."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``B`` 是对角线为零的对称矩阵。变量既可使用二元定义域 "
":math:`\\{0, 1\\}`，也可使用自旋定义域 :math:`\\{-1, +1\\}`。变量名和"
"向量顺序均被显式指定，所有系数数组都会被复制并设为只读。"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:76
msgid "QUBO matrices use the convention"
msgstr "QUBO 矩阵采用如下约定"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:78
msgid "E(x) = x^T Qx + c."
msgstr "E(x) = x^T Qx + c."

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:82
msgid ""
"QuSpect accepts upper-triangular, lower-triangular, symmetric, or mixed QUBO "
"matrices and normalizes opposing entries into one pair coefficient.  The "
"canonical exported QUBO matrix is upper triangular."
msgstr ""
"QuSpect 接受上三角、下三角、对称或混合形式的 QUBO 矩阵，并将两个相对位置"
"的元素归一化为一个成对系数。导出的规范 QUBO 矩阵为上三角矩阵。"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:87
msgid "Ising conversion"
msgstr "Ising 转换"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:89
msgid "Binary and spin variables are related by"
msgstr "二元变量与自旋变量的关系为"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:91
msgid "s = 2x - 1,\\qquad x = \\frac{s + 1}{2}."
msgstr "s = 2x - 1,\\qquad x = \\frac{s + 1}{2}."

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:95
msgid ""
"``binary_to_ising`` and ``ising_to_binary`` retain the complete constant "
"offset and preserve the objective value for every assignment.  The logical "
"``IsingProblem`` convention is"
msgstr ""
"``binary_to_ising`` 和 ``ising_to_binary`` 会保留完整的常数偏移量，并使"
"每个变量赋值的目标值保持不变。逻辑 ``IsingProblem`` 采用如下约定"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:99
msgid "E(s) = c + h^T s + \\frac{1}{2} s^T Js."
msgstr "E(s) = c + h^T s + \\frac{1}{2} s^T Js."

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:104
msgid "Hardware matrix lowering"
msgstr "硬件矩阵降级转换"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:106
msgid ""
"``HardwareIsingProgram`` represents the exact dense matrix at the Ising-"
"machine boundary.  Its hardware energy convention is"
msgstr ""
"``HardwareIsingProgram`` 表示 Ising 机边界处的确切稠密矩阵。其硬件能量"
"约定为"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:109
msgid "E_\\mathrm{hw}(t) = -t^T Mt."
msgstr "E_\\mathrm{hw}(t) = -t^T Mt."

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:113
msgid ""
"The matrix is finite, symmetric, and has a zero diagonal.  A logical linear "
"field is converted into a coupling to an auxiliary gauge spin.  Local decode "
"metadata fixes that gauge to ``+1``, removes auxiliary spins, and restores "
"the original objective using an explicit scale and offset."
msgstr ""
"该矩阵的元素有限、矩阵对称且对角线为零。逻辑线性场会被转换为与辅助规范"
"自旋的耦合。局部解码元数据将该规范自旋固定为 ``+1``，移除辅助自旋，并"
"使用显式的缩放因子和偏移量恢复原始目标。"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:118
msgid ""
"Because the provider evaluates the full symmetric matrix, each off-diagonal "
"entry appears twice in :math:`t^T Mt`.  Lowering therefore writes :math:`-"
"\\frac{1}{2}J_{ij}` for a logical pair coefficient :math:`J_{ij}` and :math:"
"`-\\frac{1}{2}h_i` for a field coupled to the gauge spin.  This factor is "
"part of the transport contract, not an optimizer-specific convention."
msgstr ""
"由于供应商会计算完整的对称矩阵，因此每个非对角元素在 :math:`t^T Mt` 中"
"出现两次。所以，降级转换针对逻辑成对系数 :math:`J_{ij}` 写入 "
":math:`-\\frac{1}{2}J_{ij}`，针对与规范自旋耦合的场写入 "
":math:`-\\frac{1}{2}h_i`。这一因子属于传输契约的一部分，而不是特定于"
"优化器的约定。"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:124
msgid ""
"The provider-neutral lowering and CSV codec are local transformations only; "
"they do not perform authentication, networking, task creation, or result "
"polling:"
msgstr ""
"供应商无关的降级转换和 CSV 编解码器仅执行本地转换；它们不执行身份认证、"
"网络通信、任务创建或结果轮询："

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:149
msgid "For every valid logical assignment, compilation guarantees"
msgstr "对于每个有效的逻辑赋值，编译过程保证"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:151
msgid ""
"E_\\mathrm{logical}\n"
"=\n"
"\\mathrm{objective\\_scale}\\,E_\\mathrm{hw}\n"
"+ \\mathrm{objective\\_offset}."
msgstr ""
"E_\\mathrm{logical}\n"
"=\n"
"\\mathrm{objective\\_scale}\\,E_\\mathrm{hw}\n"
"+ \\mathrm{objective\\_offset}."

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:158
msgid ""
"This equality is the primary compatibility invariant for future local and "
"remote optimization backends."
msgstr ""
"这一等式是未来本地和远程优化后端所遵循的首要兼容性不变量。"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:162
msgid "Local execution"
msgstr "本地执行"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:164
msgid ""
"``NativeIsingSolver`` consumes ``HardwareIsingProgram`` directly, so the "
"local C++ simulator and a future remote adapter share the same validated "
"matrix boundary.  See :doc:`ising_solver` for its algorithm, complexity, and "
"determinism guarantees."
msgstr ""
"``NativeIsingSolver`` 直接接收 ``HardwareIsingProgram``，因此本地 C++ "
"模拟器和未来的远程适配器将共享同一个经过验证的矩阵边界。有关其算法、"
"复杂度和确定性保证，请参阅 :doc:`ising_solver`。"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:169
msgid "The complete local path is:"
msgstr "完整的本地执行路径如下："

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:188
msgid ""
"Replacing ``NativeIsingSolver`` with a future remote backend will not change "
"``hardware.matrix``, its variable order, or the local decode metadata."
msgstr ""
"未来以远程后端替换 ``NativeIsingSolver`` 时，无需更改 "
"``hardware.matrix``、其变量顺序或本地解码元数据。"

#: ../../source/optimization.rst:197
msgid ""
"See :doc:`optimization_applications` for reusable model families and "
"complete portfolio-selection and wireless-channel-assignment examples."
msgstr ""
"有关可复用的模型族以及完整的投资组合选择和无线信道分配示例，请参阅 "
":doc:`optimization_applications`。"
